<title>USA: FINAL PRICING - Encina Fin Jt Pwrs Auth, Calif.</title>
<headline>FINAL PRICING - Encina Fin Jt Pwrs Auth, Calif.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stone &amp; Youngberg LLC said it priced $18.640 million of Encina Financing Joint Powers Authority, Calif., wastewater revenue refunding bonds, 1997 Series A, with a top yield of 5.45 percent in 2014.</p>
